TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Olamaz!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Kim bu diye düşünüyordum.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}
Senmişsin,{{TAG:0007:0000:03000000}} değil mi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Yanlış anlama,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} ama yüzün çok kötü
durumda! Böyle fena sokulmak hâlâ acıyor
olmalı!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Biraz ilaç kullan
da çabucak iyileş.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Oh, capperini!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Stai bene?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Hai la faccia piena di puntini rossi
non meglio identificati.{{TAG:000A:001B:010004000800}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Oh, mais bien sûr !{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Figure-toi que
j'ai justement un remède sur moi !{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Tiens, avale ça et adieu la douleur !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Gli alveari{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} sono terribili. Devi fare{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
molta attenzione!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Poverin{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
